{%- comment -%}
  Inline SVG icons. Kept inline so they inherit currentColor and cost no
  extra request.

  Usage: {% render 'icon', icon: 'cart' %}
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- case icon -%}
  {%- when 'menu' -%}
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <path d="M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h16" />
    </svg>
  {%- when 'close' -%}
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <path d="M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18" />
    </svg>
  {%- when 'search' -%}
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="6.5" />
      <path d="M16 16l4.5 4.5" />
    </svg>
  {%- when 'cart' -%}
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <path d="M4 6h2l1.6 10.4A2 2 0 0 0 9.6 18h7.9a2 2 0 0 0 2-1.6L21 9H7" />
      <circle cx="10" cy="21" r="1.1" fill="currentColor" stroke="none" />
      <circle cx="18" cy="21" r="1.1" fill="currentColor" stroke="none" />
    </svg>
  {%- when 'account' -%}
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <circle cx="12" cy="8.5" r="3.75" />
      <path d="M4.5 20a7.5 7.5 0 0 1 15 0" />
    </svg>
  {%- when 'arrow-right' -%}
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" />
    </svg>

  {%- comment -%} Navigation icons — the design's own 20x20 drawings. {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- when 'nav-account' -%}
    <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <circle cx="10" cy="7.1" r="3.2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" />
      <path d="M4.3 16.8c0-3.1 2.5-5.2 5.7-5.2s5.7 2.1 5.7 5.2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" />
    </svg>
  {%- when 'nav-search' -%}
    <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <circle cx="9" cy="9" r="6.3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" />
      <line x1="13.8" y1="13.8" x2="18.2" y2="18.2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" />
    </svg>
  {%- when 'nav-bag' -%}
    <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <path d="M4.6 6.5h10.8l-.9 10.7H5.5z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linejoin="round" />
      <path d="M7.2 6.3V5.2a2.8 2.8 0 0 1 5.6 0v1.1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" />
    </svg>

  {%- comment -%}
    The bag with a plus notched out of it — the mask is what keeps the bag's
    outline from running through the plus.

    **The mask's id has to be unique per render, and the caller supplies it.**
    This icon appears more than once on a page — four times on the home page
    between the lookbook's card and its rows — and a fixed id put four `<mask
    id="gj-bag-plus">` elements in one document. Duplicate ids are invalid HTML,
    and every `url(#…)` resolves to whichever came first, so all four bags were
    punched by the *first* icon's mask. It looked correct only because the four
    masks were identical: remove the first from the DOM — a cart re-render, a
    scene swap — and the other three lose their notch.

    **`{% increment %}` was the obvious fix and does not work here.**
    `{% render %}` isolates increment counters exactly as it isolates `assign`
    variables, so the snippet got 0 on every call and produced four identical
    ids again. Measured rather than assumed: the same `{% increment %}` emits
    `[0][1][2]` from inside a section and `[0][1]` through a `capture` there,
    and `0` every time from in here. Anything needing a per-render token in a
    snippet has to be handed one.

    So `uid` is required of any caller that may render this more than once on a
    page, and `veylin-lint`'s R12 fails the build if a call site omits it — a
    convention nobody has to remember.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- when 'bag-plus' -%}
    {%- assign bag_mask = 'gj-bag-plus' -%}
    {%- if uid != blank -%}
      {%- assign bag_mask = 'gj-bag-plus-' | append: uid -%}
    {%- endif -%}
    <svg width="19" height="19" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <mask id="{{ bag_mask }}" maskUnits="userSpaceOnUse" x="0" y="0" width="20" height="20">
        <rect width="20" height="20" fill="#fff" />
        <circle cx="15.1" cy="16.7" r="5.1" fill="#000" />
      </mask>
      <path d="M4.6 6.5h10.8l-.9 10.7H5.5z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linejoin="round" mask="url(#{{ bag_mask }})" />
      <path d="M7.2 6.3V5.2a2.8 2.8 0 0 1 5.6 0v1.1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" />
      <path d="M15.1 14.05v5.3M12.45 16.7h5.3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" />
    </svg>

  {%- comment -%} Promise emblems — drawn on the design's 40x40 grid. {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- when 'shipping' -%}
    <svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" width="30" height="30" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <path d="M3.5 12.5h17.5v14H3.5z" />
      <path d="M21 17.5h5.6l4.4 5v4H21z" />
      <circle cx="10.2" cy="29" r="2.6" />
      <circle cx="25.6" cy="29" r="2.6" />
    </svg>
  {%- when 'support' -%}
    <svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" width="30" height="30" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <circle cx="17" cy="17.5" r="8.5" />
      <circle cx="26.5" cy="26" r="6" />
    </svg>
  {%- when 'secure' -%}
    <svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" width="30" height="30" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <rect x="12" y="18.5" width="16" height="13" />
      <path d="M15.5 18.5v-4a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 9 0v4" />
      <circle cx="20" cy="25" r="1.5" />
    </svg>
  {%- when 'handcraft' -%}
    <svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" width="30" height="30" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <path d="M20 10l9 7-9 14-9-14z" />
      <path d="M11 17h18" />
      <path d="M20 10l-3.2 7 3.2 14 3.2-14z" />
    </svg>
  {%- when 'certified' -%}
    <svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" width="30" height="30" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <circle cx="20" cy="17" r="8" />
      <path d="M16.6 17.3l2.5 2.5 4.5-4.8" />
      <path d="M15 23.9l-2 7.1 7-3 7 3-2-7.1" />
    </svg>
{%- endcase -%}
